  "post_title": "Campus en Onda prepara una cena especial este viernes antes de la obra de Xavi Castillo",
  "post_date": "2013-03-22 07:15:23",
  "post_name": "campus-en-onda-prepara-una-cena-especial-este-viernes-antes-de-la-obra-de-xavi-castillo",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Cultura y Espectáculos|Fiestas|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p>Los Salones Campus, en Onda,&nbsp;han preparado una men&uacute; especial, por 18 euros, para cenar desde las 20 horas, antes de la actuaci&oacute;n all&iacute; mismo de Xavi Castillo, prevista para las 22 horas y organizada por Dones Progressistes dentro del Mar&ccedil; de la Dona.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/02/XaviCastilloOnda2012.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>El men&uacute; est&aacute; compuesto de ensalada Campus, tabla de pat&eacute;s y quesos, y crujiente de piquillo, de entrantes. A elegir pato o emperador, de segundo, y delicias choco, como postre. Est&aacute; incluida la primera bebida. Las reservas pueden realizarse en el tel&eacute;fono 964605335.</p>\n<p>Xavi Castillo presentar&aacute; su &#39;Veriue-ho Show&#39; y las entradas est&aacute;n agotadas desde hace d&iacute;as, como tambi&eacute;n se acabaron en su actuaci&oacute;n del a&ntilde;o pasado en el Teatro M&oacute;naco (a la que pertenecen las fotos de la galer&iacute;a de im&aacute;genes), organizada tambi&eacute;n por Dones Progressistes d&#39;Onda dentro del Mar&ccedil; de la Dona 2012.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xavicastilloonda150312/img_0508.jpg\" alt=\"img_0508\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xavicastilloonda150312/img_0509.jpg\" alt=\"img_0509\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xavicastilloonda150312/img_0510.jpg\" alt=\"img_0510\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xavicastilloonda150312/img_0511.jpg\" alt=\"img_0511\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xavicastilloonda150312/img_0512.jpg\" alt=\"img_0512\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xavicastilloonda150312/img_0513.jpg\" alt=\"img_0513\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xavicastilloonda150312/img_0514.jpg\" alt=\"img_0514\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xavicastilloonda150312/img_0515.jpg\" alt=\"img_0515\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xavicastilloonda150312/img_0516.jpg\" alt=\"img_0516\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xavicastilloonda150312/img_0517.jpg\" alt=\"img_0517\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xavicastilloonda150312/img_0518.jpg\" alt=\"img_0518\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xavicastilloonda150312/img_0519.jpg\" alt=\"img_0519\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xavicastilloonda150312/img_0520.jpg\" alt=\"img_0520\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xavicastilloonda150312/img_0521.jpg\" alt=\"img_0521\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xavicastilloonda150312/img_0522.jpg\" alt=\"img_0522\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xavicastilloonda150312/img_0523.jpg\" alt=\"img_0523\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xavicastilloonda150312/img_0524.jpg\" alt=\"img_0524\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976